 /2026/08/Noche-De-Liberacion-at-Axelrad-Beer-Garden.jpg
UID:K3OUb_ANlpvcE3zRoFcZW
SUMMARY:Noche De Liberación at Axelrad Beer Garden
DTSTAMP:20260819T033133Z
DTSTART:20260821T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Workers Defense Project hosts Noche De Liberación\, an evening 
	of community and solidarity with immigrant workers and families in Texas\,
	 at Axelrad Beer Garden. \nAll are welcome to show up and enjoy music\, pi
	zza\, lotería\, banner painting\, and a signature cocktail while spending 
	time with neighbors and fellow supporters. \nFor every signature event coc
	ktail ordered at the event\, Axelrad will donate $1 to Workers Defense. \n
	Families and all ages are welcome. Axelrad becomes 21+ only at 8pm. Axelra
	d’s Noches Calientes with Discoteka follows the event for ages 21+. \nThe 
	fundraiser supports Workers Defense\, and donations are welcome at any tim
	e. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was 
	sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images a
	nd more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\,
	 business\, or offer across all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhou
	ston.com/calendar/noche-de-liberacion-at-axelrad-beer-garden/\n\nFrom 365 
	Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/noche-de-liberacion-at-axelrad-
	beer-garden/
LOCATION:Axelrad Beer Garden\, 1517 Alabama St\, Houston\, TX\, 77004\, Uni
	ted States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
