	 Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260819T033133Z
DTSTART:20260828T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre welcomes Classic Albums Live back to the
	 Hermann Park stage for a live concert recreating The Eagles’ Hotel Califo
	rnia note for note and cut for cut under the stars. \nHotel California is 
	one of the best-selling albums of all time by one of the most renowned Ame
	rican rock bands in music history. \nGuests can sing along to favorite son
	gs like “Victim of Love”\, “Life in the Fast Lane”\, “Hotel California”\, 
	and more—all played to perfect perfection. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller O
	utdoor Theatre \nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free\, but covered se
	ating for popular evening shows usually requires a free assigned ticket re
	served 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting free seated tickets
	 at Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket.
	 \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer 
	and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more ab
	out promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all o
	f our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/classic-albums-
	live-the-eagles-hotel-california-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/\n\nFrom 365 Th
	ings to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/classic-albums-live-the-eagles-
	hotel-california-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/
