 /2026/07/Cirque-tacular-The-Art-of-Circus-at-Miller-Outdoor-Theatre.jpeg
UID:-3OGq0UIWi6k5YFQdLdEt
SUMMARY:Cirque-tacular: The Art of Circus at Miller Outdoor Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260819T033133Z
DTSTART:20260829T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre presents Cirque-tacular: The Art of Circ
	us under the stars on the Hermann Park stage. \nStep into a world where Va
	n Gogh’s swirling skies\, Da Vinci’s timeless genius\, and Picasso’s bold 
	visions leap off the canvas and into motion. \nThe Art of Circus reimagine
	s history’s greatest masterpieces through gravity-defying acrobatics\, mes
	merizing dance\, and jaw-dropping feats of strength and grace. \nWith cost
	umes inspired by iconic works\, a musical score that sweeps you through ce
	nturies of artistic brilliance\, and a cast of world-class performers\, th
	is production transforms the stage into a living gallery. \nFinding Your S
	eat at Miller Outdoor Theatre \nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free\,
	 but covered seating for popular evening shows usually requires a free ass
	igned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting free
	 seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free
	 seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the e
	vent organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  
	\nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or off
	er across all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/
	cirque-tacular-the-art-of-circus-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/\n\nFrom 365 Th
	ings to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/cirque-tacular-the-art-of-circu
	s-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/
LOCATION:Miller Outdoor Theatre\, 6000 Hermann Park Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 770
	30\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ACDC-PWRUP-Pop-Up-at-Henke-Pillot.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/08/ACDC-PWRUP-Pop-Up-at-Henke-Pillot.jpg
UID:Jrlx51zEN2uBNfWNigdEc
SUMMARY:AC/DC PWR/UP Pop Up at Henke & Pillot
DTSTAMP:20260819T033133Z
DTSTART:20260830T120000Z
DESCRIPTION:In advance of AC/DC’s live concert at Reliant Stadium on Monday
	\, August 31\, the free\, official AC/DC PWR/UP Pop Up lands at Henke & Pi
	llot across from Market Square Park in Downtown Houston. \nFans and curiou
	s guests can gather\, shop exclusive merchandise\, explore iconic AC/DC pr
	ops and photo opportunities\, and extend the concert experience around the
	 band’s Houston stop. \nThe first 200 fans through the door will also rece
	ive a free commemorative pop-up poster. \nNo concert tickets are required.
	 \n\n\nAdmission\nFree\, including without tickets to the AC/DC concert at
